import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---
<ResearchLayout title="Evidence｜J 的世界 Research" page="P2">
<div class="editorial-page">
  <div class="page-kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P2</div>
  <div class="page-meta"><span>SIGNAL <b>Evidence</b></span><span>EVIDENCE <b>FACTS FIRST</b></span><span>FOCUS <b>AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION</b></span></div>
  <h1 class="page-title">先把「事實」與「推論」分開</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">FACTS FIRST · EVIDENCE BEFORE CONCLUSION</p>
  <div class="editorial-rule"></div>
  <div class="lead-grid">
    <div class="lead-visual"><div class="visual-label">EVIDENCE FRAMEWORK</div><div class="visual-big">FACT<br><em>→</em><br>INFERENCE</div><div class="visual-lines"></div></div>
    <aside class="lead-note"><span class="tag">EVIDENCE</span><h2>研究的第一步，是把證據的層級說清楚。</h2><p>公開資訊、公司揭露與官方技術資料優先；當證據不足時，推論必須被明確標示，而不是偽裝成事實。</p></aside>
  </div>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">FACT</div><h2>先進製程持續演進</h2></div></div><div class="editorial-card"><div class="num">FACT</div><h3>3nm · 2nm · A16 · A14</h3><p>台積電官方 2026 Technology Symposium 涵蓋 3nm、2nm、A16、A14 及後續技術。</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">FACT</div><h2>3DFabric 持續擴展</h2></div></div><div class="editorial-card"><div class="num">FACT</div><h3>SoIC · InFO · CoWoS · SoW</h3><p>官方議程涵蓋多項先進封裝技術。</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">INFERENCE</div><h2>AI 平台瓶頸正在系統化</h2></div></div><div class="editorial-card gold"><div class="num">INFERENCE</div><h3>瓶頸不再只有晶片</h3><p>當製程與封裝同步演進，互連、材料、散熱與電力的重要性也必須放進同一研究框架。</p></div></section>
  
</div>
</ResearchLayout>
